					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "We'd like to use the data from the [2016 paper](https://scg.unibe.ch/assets/scgbib/?query=Meri16a) and the [2017 journal paper](https://scg.unibe.ch/assets/scgbib/?query=Meri17a)as a running example for the [[VISSOFT 2026]] talk.\nSee the [replication package](https://scg.unibe.ch/research/visualisation-review).\nThe UTF-8 CSV link: [](https://scg.unibe.ch/download/merino/review-vissoft/dataset-utf8.zip)."
			},
